# This repo's own .gitignore. It is deliberately NOT the artifact.
#
# The artifact is ultimate.gitignore, kept as a separate file for the same
# reason github/gitignore keeps Python.gitignore separate: a repo whose own
# .gitignore is the template ends up ignoring its own test fixtures.
# Spec Kit and BMAD both hit that trap and had to write "these lines are for
# dogfooding, do not copy them" into their files. This avoids it.

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp

# Agent config for working on this repo. Per the file's own rule: personal
# overrides out, team intent in.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.idea/workspace.xml
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
